  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gomuks/gomuks/tarball/v0.2611.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gomuks/gomuks/zipball/v0.2611.0",
  "body": "Release post: <https://mau.fi/blog/2026-11-mautrix-release/>\r\n\r\n### Backend\r\n* Added RFC 10036 `Incremental` header for SSE connections so compatible reverse proxies like Caddy disable buffering.\r\n* Added per-message profile info to push data.\r\n* Added support for FCM push gateways specified by the frontend.\r\n  * Currently, the push gateways need to be whitelisted in the config.\r\n* Added support for OAuth step-up auth with existing OAuth login methods.\r\n* Added methods for viewing and updating room directory.\r\n* Added config option to not delete media cache on logout.\r\n  * This is recommended if you share the media cache between multiple instances.\r\n* Added method to get the MSC4391 definitions of internal gomuks commands (thanks to @Henry-Hiles in #773).\r\n* Added method for upgrading rooms (thanks to @Henry-Hiles in #774).\r\n* Added caching theme proxy.\r\n  * To use it, simply replace `https://css.gomuks.app` with `_gomuks` in your CSS imports.\r\n  * The cache will keep previously loaded themes working even if it can't reach css.gomuks.app.\r\n  * If you link to a specific commit, the backend will cache it permanently and will never refetch. Non-specific commits are refetched at most once an hour.\r\n* Changed `get_mentions` to never return a null array.\r\n* Changed default build scripts to build with goolm.\r\n* Changed event processing to preserve unknown top-level fields. They'll be placed under a custom `unknown_top_level` field.\r\n* Fixed event decryption lock not being acquired for sync properly, which lead to some database queries timing out and failing due to deadlocks.\r\n\r\n### Web\r\n* Bumped minimum browser versions to Firefox 153, Chrome 155 and Safari 27.\r\n* Added support for stable policy list rooms.\r\n\r\n### C FFI\r\n* Added push message info to push notification handling instead of only returning raw event and room info.   \r\n  * Clients should prefer using only the pre-processed push data.\r\n* Added method to reset network connections.\r\n  * Clients should listen to OS-level network change events and call this to reconnect faster.\r\n* Added method to pause sync without stopping the client entirely.\r\n* Added `GomuksAllocBuffer` for platforms where malloc isn't easily available (thanks to @Henry-Hiles in #771).\r\n",
  "mentions_count": 1
}
